  "details": "im currenlty emailing vrchat support on the update they came out with regarding trust and safety thing. i do not stand for any type of being labeled or being treated as lesser\\higher of an individual player of vrchat .my trust rank was lowered to the green name plate from known user. it happen because my friends kept kicking me several times then eventauly started a vote kick on me without any given reason . in conclusion, i dont like this. even the first day i updated my game and noticed there was this new feature \"safety and trust\" i joined a public world then approached two players with a purple nameplate(trusted user) i was treated like a peasant lol they acted so damn stuck up , thats really edgy btw . thanks and i will be looking forward to hearing back.",
